{"title":"2017 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 2a","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Verifying_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Verifying Solution</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2017 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There is one pair <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/e/28e24c43456d95b5ab8d4f2f8f85a644e98b7ed3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a, b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> of positive integers for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/2/842f8c4a6c9ada51fbb2df1656864cc8f049a29d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5a + 3b = 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"102\" height=\"16\" />. What are the values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Multiplying both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/5/6a56b470f7b08a33bbac654a3408a919aca7970d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x(x - 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"68\" height=\"20\" /> to get rid of the fraction on the left hand side and some of the fractions on the right hand side, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/2/2e27366308a2aa999c6e20f1b52a0c7b8cf9f2cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x(x - 1) \\times \\frac{5}{x(x - 1)} = x(x - 1) \\times (\\frac{1}{x} + \\frac{1}{x - 1})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"370\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/9/db9a6d42a7d5ca3c818a00fc199a1f36401e5281.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 = x - 1 + x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"109\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/b/48bb00fd4fc037231c6736d08be2c4308be14e0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x - 1 = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"86\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/2/4a2ffbba065dc4426b5a687e785bda680761b61e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x = 5 + 1 = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"119\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/0/c8025e21400bd8b1618e2abf3c6f234143643c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{6}{2} = \\boxed{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"94\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Verifying_Solution\">Verifying Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Verifying Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/0/690ef55a607beaf2389d1ee102df817721bc2392.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> into the original equation (what we got for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />), we have the following for the left hand side:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/1/4218ea96533929f82c9f649e0d229635d5f4180f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5}{3(3 - 1)} = \\frac{5}{3 \\times 2} = \\frac{5}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"175\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p>Plugging this into the right hand side, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/7/7276e03e102ef45fbc735b5497f8fa8f1eba015b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{3} + \\frac{1}{3 - 1} = \\frac{1}{3} + \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"154\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/0/130d990a8c90a4f026661c68e83a5f1702d3ca40.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{1 \\times 2}{3 \\times 2} + \\frac{1 \\times 3}{2 \\times 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"132\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/1/581410e449d9c561dd7cc36cb53beb2d7df8d5a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{2}{6} + \\frac{3}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"69\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cf91417952fa24e7138f3d9919fd4950aa76d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{2 + 3}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"65\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/3/dd3efaf55986f97cc67670a167fc1236a1863b90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{5}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"34\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>The left hand side would be equal to the right hand side, so we have verified that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/0/690ef55a607beaf2389d1ee102df817721bc2392.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> is indeed a solution.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018003528\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.016 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.030 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 90/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3660/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.108      1 2017_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2\n100.00%    6.108      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35974:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018003528 and revision id 279541. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}